  "definition": "MHV refers to murine hepatitis virus, a coronavirus that infects mice and can cause hepatitis. Different strains have been identified, including one that targets nervous system tissue and can produce widespread brain and spinal cord inflammation with loss of myelin, as well as localized liver tissue death.",
